# No unsolicited hints

- Do **not** add field hints, helper text, instructional blurbs, “how to edit” callouts, or grey guidance under inputs unless the user explicitly asks for them.
- Do **not** reintroduce a `hint` prop or similar directional copy on forms.
- Placeholders are fine only when the user wants them or they already exist in the copy catalog - do not invent new instructional placeholders (e.g. “Type and press Enter…”).
- Prefer bare labels and controls; keep UI copy minimal.
